    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71138925b33231f10054009",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一说到此处，\n突然全身虚脱，差点再次倒地。\n这次她精疲力尽，连声音都发不出来了──",
      "source_fingerprint": "deb82cd0d00fcf0b3559f4dd10ff18aef59191c3e7fc4da1aa6f1642d0e4cfac",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
