      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果那天稻荷一到保健室\n检查过病况后，\n就回宿舍静养了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "844f6bf4b15cd63f010de0940cc473c9de6e22865ea1bac5a793be94ca568915",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1034/storytimeline_501034322.json",
      "json_path": [
