        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1b0bc273ffb61fa824a548",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "根据诊断，她之所以晕倒，\n除了肉体疲劳外根本原因来自精神──\n她背负了太多的心理负担。",
      "source_fingerprint": "89d26b03aa7a04f71583cfa6594fe4f9166007625eb46c69a06c914657fda60a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
