      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了帮助她恢复成\n原本那个潇洒的稻荷一……\n我这个伙伴能做的就是──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b392111301491da68ac6c38f1065cc9aaab87360dd0eeb382b718817d2aaefee",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
