      "uid": "zhcn:bc71bdd654be6f11015d8442",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "稻荷一与庶民区居民间的情谊\n永存于她的跑姿之中。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6246a3381d0cd3331a4d3c893ecf4f0a2b39c8b07dbb32ffc337f1ba6015215c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
